</run>
              <run fontsize="10">Source: State of Victoria / DEECA, Victorian Land Cover Time Series (2020), CC BY 4.0. Seven multi-year epochs; first file labels 1985-1990. Shares use classified area only. Units overlap and must not be summed. Land cover is not habitat condition or evidence of management outcomes.</run>
